OL,3,GNEWSAInquiry expected into housing
OL,4,Ascheme 'exploitation'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere have been claims of fraud, crime,
OL,7,Fpoor housing and firms receiving
OL,8,Fhousing benefits on behalf of residents
OL,9,Fbut not giving them the support they
OL,10,Fare meant to.
OL,12,FA government spokesperson said it
OL,13,Fwanted to ensure "poor providers" could
OL,14,Fnot "take advantage of the system
OL,15,Fdesigned to help the most vulnerable".
